  "releaseNotes": "RELEASE NOTES:\n=================\nThe UI library for building fast and beautiful WinForms apps in C#, VB.NET and Visual Studio IDE.\n\n* IMPORTANT PLEASE READ:\n- Back up all your projects BEFORE updating.\n- Read about the changes, enhancements and improvements BEFORE updating.\n- Contact us if you have any questions BEFORE updating your library.\n------------------------------\n\nENHANCED COMPONENTS:\n\n# Siticone Navbar: Improved performance and the UI rendering system.\n# Siticone Activity Button: Added new properties, features, improved performance.\n\n\n🔥NEW COMPONENTS:\n\nNone",
